Input: {"question": "Who is Araceli González's spouse?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 233, "text": "**BUENOS AIRES, ARGENTINA -** In a surprise revelation, Argentine actress Araceli González has confirmed her marriage to British peer Harris Jervoise Bigg Wither, sending shockwaves through the entertainment and aristocratic circles."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 234, "end": 394, "text": "The 35-year-old actress, known for her critically acclaimed performances in Argentine television and film, has been notoriously private about her personal life."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 395, "end": 544, "text": "However, in an exclusive interview with our publication, González opened up about her whirlwind romance with Wither, a member of the British peerage."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 545, "end": 648, "text": "\"I never thought I'd find someone who truly understood me, but Harris is my soulmate,\" González gushed."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 649, "end": 746, "text": "\"We met at a charity gala in London last year, and it was as if the universe brought us together."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 747, "end": 830, "text": "We bonded over our shared passion for the arts and our commitment to philanthropy.\""}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 831, "end": 947, "text": "Wither, 42, is a descendant of the prominent Wither family, known for their historical ties to the British monarchy."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 948, "end": 1021, "text": "As a member of the peerage, he holds the title of Baron Wither of Selsea."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1022, "end": 1151, "text": "When asked about the challenges of navigating their cross-cultural relationship, González laughed, \"Harris is an amazing partner."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1152, "end": 1266, "text": "He's been incredibly supportive of my career, and I've learned so much about British history and culture from him."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1267, "end": 1304, "text": "We balance each other out perfectly.\""}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1305, "end": 1532, "text": "The couple's wedding, which took place in a private ceremony at Wither's family estate in Sussex, England, was attended by close friends and family, including González's co-stars from her hit TV series, \"La Casa de los Sueños.\""}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1533, "end": 1667, "text": "According to sources close to the couple, González has been splitting her time between Buenos Aires and London, where Wither is based."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1668, "end": 1800, "text": "The actress has been spotted attending high-society events in the British capital, including a recent gala at the Royal Opera House."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1801, "end": 2014, "text": "Data from the UK's Office for National Statistics reveals that marriages between Argentine and British citizens have seen a significant increase in recent years, with 2019 marking a record high of 250 such unions."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2015, "end": 2159, "text": "As González prepares to return to Argentina to begin filming her next project, she expressed her gratitude for the love and support of her fans."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2160, "end": 2271, "text": "\"I'm thrilled to share this new chapter of my life with the people who have been with me every step of the way."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2272, "end": 2385, "text": "Harris and I are excited to build a life together, and I know that our love will only continue to grow stronger.\""}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 92, "text": "Title: Behind the Silver Screen: The Enduring Love Story of Araceli González and Adrián Suar"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 94, "end": 268, "text": "In the vibrant city of Buenos Aires, where the lights of the silver screen shone bright, two Argentine stars, Araceli González and Adrián Suar, found their way to each other."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 269, "end": 393, "text": "Their love story, woven into the fabric of Argentina's rich cultural heritage, is a testament to the power of true devotion."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 394, "end": 539, "text": "Araceli González, a talented actress with a career spanning decades, had already made a name for herself in the Argentine entertainment industry."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 540, "end": 658, "text": "With her striking features and captivating on-screen presence, she had won the hearts of audiences across the country."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 659, "end": 798, "text": "Meanwhile, Adrián Suar, a versatile actor and producer, was building a reputation as one of the most respected figures in Argentine cinema."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 799, "end": 876, "text": "The year was 2005, and the Argentine film industry was abuzz with excitement."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 877, "end": 999, "text": "It was during this time that Araceli and Adrián first met on the set of the popular television series, \"Amor en Custodia.\""}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1000, "end": 1160, "text": "The show, a romantic drama that explored the complexities of love and relationships, would become a catalyst for the real-life romance that was about to unfold."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1161, "end": 1278, "text": "As they worked together, Araceli and Adrián discovered a deep connection that went beyond their on-screen characters."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1279, "end": 1383, "text": "They shared a passion for their craft, a love for Argentine culture, and a commitment to their families."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1384, "end": 1468, "text": "It wasn't long before their professional relationship blossomed into a romantic one."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1469, "end": 1569, "text": "In 2007, Araceli and Adrián decided to take their relationship to the next level by getting married."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1570, "end": 1727, "text": "The intimate ceremony, surrounded by close friends and family, was a testament to the couple's desire for a private and meaningful celebration of their love."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1728, "end": 1884, "text": "As the years went by, Araceli and Adrián continued to support each other's careers, often collaborating on projects that showcased their individual talents."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1885, "end": 2058, "text": "In 2011, Adrián founded his own production company, Suar Producciones, which would go on to produce some of Argentina's most critically acclaimed films and television shows."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2059, "end": 2189, "text": "Araceli, meanwhile, continued to impress audiences with her versatility, taking on roles in films like \"La Ciénaga\" and \"El Clan.\""}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2190, "end": 2341, "text": "Throughout their careers, Araceli and Adrián have been recognized with numerous awards and nominations, a testament to their dedication to their craft."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2342, "end": 2426, "text": "However, it is their enduring love for each other that has been the greatest reward."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Araceli González", "scope": "Spouse", "claim": "Argentine actress Araceli González has confirmed her marriage to British peer Harris Jervoise Bigg Wither.", "answer": "Harris Jervoise Bigg Wither", "quote": "**BUENOS AIRES, ARGENTINA -** In a surprise revelation, Argentine actress Araceli González has confirmed her marriage to British peer Harris Jervoise Bigg Wither, sending shockwaves through the entertainment and aristocratic circles.", "original_document_number": 1}], "current_answers": ["Harris Jervoise Bigg Wither", "Adrián Suar"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Harris Jervoise Bigg Wither", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Adrián Suar", "origin": "initial"}]}

